Z||000013||Urchin||09-24-2001||06:21 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 85fierogt:<BR><B>yah but then it says theres no cd in your cd rom drive, when i hit ok it exits everything and brings me to my desktop, i really wanna run with you guys</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>I figured it out.  Just mail this address  MCOBetaReg@ea.com  and title it "beta code request".  They'll send you a code and you're all set.<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/final.jpg"> <BR>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||1
